<!--
  two bars, for the button that pauses a run.

  Material Symbols' own outlined pause at its 960 viewport, which is the family ic_play is drawn from:
  the two buttons swap one for the other on the panel, and an outlined arrow beside a filled pair of
  bars would read as two different sets.

  it carries no colour of its own and is tinted where it is used, like the other icon on that panel.
-->
